NO_SHOT: a reset leaves nothing to send or wait for run
afterSend: a shown shot becomes sent, anything else stays run
chatViewAction: a view replaces the chat only when its generation changed run
drawn: a stale id changes nothing run
formatHotkeyStatus: names every hotkey that failed run
formatHotkeyStatus: ready when nothing failed run
formatInitial: a leading emoji and space are skipped run
formatInitial: a name of symbols only has no initial run
formatInitial: a name without ASCII letters keeps its first letter run
formatInitial: an ASCII name is uppercased run
formatInitial: an astral first letter stays one code point run
formatInitial: punctuation and digits run
formatLastPlayed: counts back in the largest whole unit run
formatLastPlayed: never played and unreadable dates run
formatPlayTime: hours, with minutes only when verbose run
formatPlayTime: no play time reads 0h run
formatPlayTime: under an hour shows minutes run
heldShot: a hotkey take reported by shot-held lands like a button take run
heldShot: a report after a newer take is stale and changes nothing run
heldShot: a report of an older hotkey take never lands on a newer one run
isActionableLink: only a complete https link opens run
recapOffer: the line after a four-hour break, the chip only when a question can be sent run
received: a stale seq or a slot not taking returns the same object run
renderAnswer: plain past the size cap, markdown below it run
renderMode: long, slow or failed renders stay plain run
replaced: a take a newer one replaced leaves the slot empty, with no message run
saveStatusText: one line per save state, and none of them deletes run
sendBlocked: a take or a fetch in progress blocks a send run
sendableShot: an id only once the preview is shown run
sendsQuestion: Enter sends, Shift+Enter does not run
sendsQuestion: the Enter that confirms an IME composition does not send run
shot states: one of each kind is reachable run
showHintChips: shown only after a finished hinted answer run
takeFailed and drawFailed: a failure blocks nothing and sends no id run
toNodes: an inline br tag is a line break run
toNodes: an unclosed fence is a code block run
toNodes: an unknown token type becomes its raw text run
toNodes: entities decode once, code spans not at all run
toNodes: every fixture converts to the closed set of kinds run
toNodes: headings, tables, quotes and rules run
toNodes: inline marks convert in order run
toNodes: lists keep their order, start and task boxes run
toNodes: raw HTML and images stay literal text run
translatePreview: a fetched, shown or sent screenshot is on screen run
unsavedPick: a pick the launcher could not save holds when the stored one is read again run
unsavedPick: a saved pick gives way to the stored provider run
